From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dwmapi: DWM thumbnails, the deprecated entry points, DwmSetPresentParameters (3712)

dwmapi: DWM thumbnails, the deprecated entry points, DwmSetPresentParameters

DwmRegisterThumbnail, DwmUpdateThumbnailProperties, DwmUnregisterThumbnail
and the new DwmQueryThumbnailSourceSize returned E_NOTIMPL. A thumbnail
relationship now exists per process, validated as documented (top-level
windows, destination owned by the caller or the desktop), and while it is
visible a thread of the process copies the source window and paints it into
the destination in the chosen rectangle, source rectangle and opacity,
giving the area back when it is hidden or unregistered. The
deprecated DwmAttachMilContent, DwmDetachMilContent,
DwmGetGraphicsStreamClient and DwmGetGraphicsStreamTransformHint return
DWM_E_COMPOSITIONDISABLED as documented for Windows 7 and later, and
DwmSetPresentParameters returns E_NOTIMPL as documented from Windows 8.1.
